{"id":"450337","name":"霸王花胡萝卜汤","author":"elmonte","authorId":"266491","desc":"","cover":"images/450337/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"霸王花","amount":"80g"},{"name":"胡萝卜","amount":"2根"},{"name":"薏米","amount":"30g"},{"name":"山药","amount":"300g"},{"name":"蜜枣","amount":"2颗"},{"name":"瘦肉","amount":"500g"},{"name":"陈皮","amount":"3片"}],"sub":[{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"薏米用水泡30分钟。","img":"images/450337/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"霸王花干放水煮开，关火焖15分钟。","img":"images/450337/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"用水冲冼两遍，挤干水份，切小段。","img":"images/450337/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"胡萝卜去皮切块。","img":"images/450337/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"瘦肉飞水，洗净浮沫。","img":"images/450337/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"陈皮用热水泡软，刮去白膜。","img":"images/450337/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"蜜枣2颗。","img":"images/450337/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"把以上材料放入汤锅，注入适量的水，大火烧开，转小火煲1个小时。","img":"images/450337/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"山药去皮，切小块。","img":"images/450337/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"放入汤里，继续煲半小时，放盐调味即可。","img":"images/450337/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"清润养颜。","img":"images/450337/step_11.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：汤锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}